# copy-files — files copied into every new box on `d-box new`.
#
# One entry per line:
#   SOURCE                  copy SOURCE to the same path under /src
#   SOURCE -> DEST          copy SOURCE to DEST
#
# SOURCE: relative paths resolve against the repo ($DBOX_REPO); ~ = your host home;
#         absolute paths work too. The LIVE file is copied at box-creation time,
#         so it's always current (no stale snapshots).
# DEST:   /src/... for the working dir, ~/... for the box's home, or any absolute
#         path inside the box. Omit it to default to /src/<source path>.
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Examples:
#   ~/dotfiles/.vimrc       -> ~/.vimrc
#   ~/notes/scratch.md      -> /src/NOTES.md
#   config/local.yml                       # -> /src/config/local.yml

AI-AGENTS.md
